YEAR 2016
REGENT OF BENGKAYANG
WEST KALIMANTAN PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF BENGKAYANG REGENCY
NUMBER 4 YEAR 2016
CONCERNING
THE IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN
VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE
BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY
